	(text "Connectors\nJ_UI (XH 12) to the front panel: SPI display uses SCK/MOSI/CS/DC; an I2C OLED only\nSCK = SCL and MOSI = SDA (fit R105/R106 on the MCU sheet). Buttons pull to GND on the panel.\nJ_LED (XH 3): status LED off board through R501 330R: a plain LED straight to LED/GND,\nor an SK6812 (data through R501, power from VBAT_SW).\nPin orders are the contract with the front panel (hardware/README.md)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.1 160.02 0)
